//   setup points at a table: the stage's table of the data source; a callback: its routine (engine/
//   routines.csv; None: 0); StageBlockHead: 0.
// kStageSetup: {function (its routine), first write, write count, the argument of exe 0x50f280 (the encounter kinds; -1
